{"code": 200, "results": [{"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2092606305059864659", "id": "2092606305059864659", "text": "Now I'm using grok 4.6(high) and codex  5.6-sol-xhigh.  One for code, one for review, and I switch off.  \n\nLet's see how this goes.", "raw_text": {"text": "Now I'm using grok 4.6(high) and codex  5.6-sol-xhigh.  One for code, one for review, and I switch off.  \n\nLet's see how this goes.", "display_text_range": [0, 131], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282563, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 84, "reposts": 12, "likes": 825, "bookmarks": 81, "quotes": 6, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Wed Aug 26 13:33:16 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1787751196, "views": 57477, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2092307176467427631", "id": "2092307176467427631", "text": "It's important to remember that these models are leapfrogging each other every week or so.  I'm sure I'll soon be complaining about grok again.   \n\nThough...maybe not.", "raw_text": {"text": "It's important to remember that these models are leapfrogging each other every week or so.  I'm sure I'll soon be complaining about grok again.   \n\nThough...maybe not.", "display_text_range": [0, 167], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282563, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 17, "reposts": 4, "likes": 323, "bookmarks": 11, "quotes": 1, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Tue Aug 25 17:44:38 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1787679878, "views": 19250, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2092285526833316089", "id": "2092285526833316089", "text": "I stopped using grok because I was running up against the weekly limit.  I switched to codex.  Night and day.  Codex is making many more dumb mistakes.", "raw_text": {"text": "I stopped using grok because I was running up against the weekly limit.  I switched to codex.  Night and day.  Codex is making many more dumb mistakes.", "display_text_range": [0, 151], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282563, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 113, "reposts": 23, "likes": 1349, "bookmarks": 102, "quotes": 11, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Tue Aug 25 16:18:37 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1787674717, "views": 109487, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2092262702550835420", "id": "2092262702550835420", "text": "It was 18 months ago that I started getting serious about AI.  At first it was just a few simple tasks and translations.  But soon I was working hard with agents and tools.  \n\nIt's astounding how quickly things have moved, and how much better the models have become.", "raw_text": {"text": "It was 18 months ago that I started getting serious about AI.  At first it was just a few simple tasks and translations.  But soon I was working hard with agents and tools.  \n\nIt's astounding how quickly things have moved, and how much better the models have become.", "display_text_range": [0, 266], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282563, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/